                                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="20px" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="20px" fill="#1f1f1f"><path d="M480-312q20 0 32.5-13.27 12.5-13.28 12.5-32.5 0-19.23-13.07-31.73t-32-12.5Q461-402 448-389.5t-13 31.73q0 19.22 13.05 32.5Q461.1-312 480-312Zm-32-144h66q0-13.68 1-23.34t5-17.66q4-8 9.95-15.77Q535.9-520.55 547-532q20-20 38.5-40.5T604-631q0-53-36-83t-88-30q-48 0-80 27t-44 63l59 25q6-18 21-36t44-18q32 0 46 17t14 37q0 23-17 40t-36 35q-13 12-20 21t-11.5 20q-4.5 11-6 24t-1.5 33Zm32 408L336-192H216q-29 0-50.5-21.5T144-264v-528q0-29 21.5-50.5T216-864h528q29.7 0 50.85 21.5Q816-821 816-792v528q0 29-21.15 50.5T744-192H624L480-48ZM216-264h149l115 115 114-115h150v-528H216v528Zm264-264Z"/>
                                            </svg>
                                            <span class="underline-anim" style="padding-bottom: 0px;">
                                                Ajukan pertanyaan
                                            </span>
                                        </button>

                                    </div>
                                </div>

