                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" height="5rem" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" width="5rem" fill="#1f1f1f"><path d="M481-792 245-657l235 135 235-135-234-135ZM144-320v-320q0-19.77 9.45-35.94Q162.9-692.12 180-702l262.62-152.27Q452-859 460.82-862q8.82-3 19.04-3 10.21 0 19.5 3 9.28 3 17.64 8l263 152q17.1 9.88 26.55 26.06Q816-659.77 816-640v184h-72v-135L479-439 216-591v270l240 139v83L180-258q-17-9-26.5-25.45T144-320ZM720-96q9.6 0 16.8-7.2 7.2-7.2 7.2-16.8 0-9.6-7.2-16.8-7.2-7.2-16.8-7.2-9.6 0-16.8 7.2-7.2 7.2-7.2 16.8 0 9.6 7.2 16.8Q710.4-96 720-96Zm-24-96h48v-96h-48v96ZM719.77 0Q640 0 584-56.23q-56-56.22-56-136Q528-272 584.23-328q56.22-56 136-56Q800-384 856-327.77q56 56.22 56 136Q912-112 855.77-56q-56.22 56-136 56ZM480-487Z"/></svg>
